WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — rce-vc (yo) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.623
<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, ọpọlọpọ awọn eniyan ati awọn aṣoju AI kọ ni akoko kanna, ati pe ayẹwo ti a pe ni orukọ gba awọn iyipada tabi awọn iwe-aṣẹ idi.

2
00:00:10.703 --> 00:00:24.085
<v Narrator>Àwọn ààyè-iṣẹ́ tí a kò ní orukọ nípa ìṣàfihàn àwọn àyọkà àkọsilẹ̀ jẹ́ pé àwọn ìṣàmúlò-ètò tí kò ní ibatan lè lọ papọ̀ láti ó fi ìrìn-àwọ̀ pamọ́.

3
00:00:24.165 --> 00:00:33.190
<v Narrator>Oju-iwe ayelujara ti o wa nibẹ, pẹlu awọn oju-iwe 100,000, jẹ ọkan ninu awọn aaye ayelujara ti o tobi julọ ni agbaye.
